    <h2 class="sr-only">Mersive Solstice software access</h2>
    <div class="mdna reveal vis"><h3>The software-access policy, in plain language</h3>
      <p>If a Mersive Solstice subscription lapses, the rooms don't brick: <b>installed software keeps working exactly as installed.</b> What stops is what the subscription funds: new updates, security patches, and support. Reinstate the subscription and updates resume. That's the whole policy, and it lives in public where your procurement team can cite it.</p>
      <div class="concede">[Wording placeholder — verify this summary against the published software-access policy before launch; the published policy text is canonical, this page paraphrases it.]</div>
    </div>

