      <h2>Polaris Pro continues your line.</h2>
      <p>Mersive Solstice Gen 3 grew into Polaris: same mission, same lineage, and both generations supported side by side while you move. Your rooms have a mapped upgrade path with a swap program in motion, your workflows carry forward, and Mersive Solstice Cloud and Polaris Cloud stay linked: one starting point for the whole estate while you migrate. On your schedule, with your reseller.</p>
